[00:00.000] 作词 : STOLEN秘密行动
[00:01.000] 作曲 : STOLEN秘密行动
[00:02.000] 编曲 : STOLEN秘密行动
[00:47.266] Everyone just stood and watched me floating,
[00:51.513] floating off the ground,
[00:56.298]
[00:56.298]
[00:59.050] Blinking lights and hollow stares—no hands,
[01:02.662] no hands to pull me down.
[01:06.657]
[01:06.657]
[01:10.521] Banging air, it’s thick, it hums, it sneers,
[01:13.962] runs cold along my spine,
[01:19.134]
[01:19.134]
[01:21.980] Glasses clinking, voices bleeding,
[01:30.006] calling out to me again
[01:33.533]
[01:33.533]
[01:48.465] Everyone just passing the poison from someone to you
[01:56.123] These words cut through the tension, leave you black and blue.
[02:03.975] Even you hate the taste of poison, yet you stay in line
[02:11.471] You drift between the danger and danger, bruises hollow.
[02:22.937]
[02:22.937]
[03:43.303] Falling through the sound,
[03:58.761] Spinning on the ground,
[04:14.143] melted by the sun,
[04:36.933] The sun…
[04:45.140]
